#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Vehicle data: Brand + logo > Model > Year (no photo) > Version (name, engine, seats) + photo. The Excel import now creates brands that do
 * not exist yet (with the logo from the new "Brand Logo" column, else "No logo yet") and updates existing brands (Arabic / Chinese names, and
 * the logo when the file has one). A year without its own photo shows its first version's photo in the app and website.
 *
 *   node scripts/patch-vehicle-steps.js            dry run
 *   node scripts/patch-vehicle-steps.js --write    applies it (each changed file is saved as <file>.before-vehicle-steps first)
 */
